<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WORLD DOUBLES CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WORLD DOUBLES CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Connecticut 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>round-robin Phoenix/ATP Tour World Doubles Championship</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p>Round robin:</p>
<p>Libor Pimek (Belgium) and Byron Talbot (South Africa) beat</p>
<p>Jacco Eltingh and Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 6-7 (7-5) 7-5</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Trevor Kronemann (U.S.) and David Macpherson (Australia)</p>
<p>beat Nicklas Kulti and Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 4-6 7-5 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2 ).</p>
<p>Sebastien Lareau (Canada) and Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge and Mark Woodforde (Australia) 4-6 6-3 7-5.</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) and Scott Connell (Canada) beat</p>
<p>Mark Knowles (South Africa) and Daniel Nestor (Canada)</p>
<p>walkover.</p>
</text>
